@startuml
title PayLink - Payment Life Cycle State Diagram

[*] --> Initiated

Initiated --> FundsHeld : Fraud checks pass\nand wallet has enough funds
Initiated --> Rejected : Fraud check fails\nor funds are insufficient

FundsHeld --> SentToBiller : Request sent to biller

SentToBiller --> Completed : Biller confirms
SentToBiller --> Failed : Biller refuses
SentToBiller --> Unknown : No answer within timeout

Unknown --> Completed : Biller later confirms\n(callback, retry or settlement file)
Unknown --> Failed : Biller later refuses\nor reconciliation finds no payment

Failed --> Refunded : Hold released to wallet

Completed --> [*]
Rejected --> [*]
Refunded --> [*]

note right of Unknown
  Money remains held.
  Never refunded automatically.
  Return money only when the system
  is sure the biller did not receive it.
end note

note right of Completed
  Final state
end note

note right of Rejected
  Final state
end note

note right of Refunded
  Final state
end note

@enduml
